{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Xiao Jun&quot; is a narrative-driven RPG that tells the turbulent life story of a boy determined to take control of his own fate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a harsh childhood in the countryside to the unforgiving rules of survival in the city, players will experience a powerful journey filled with betrayal, revenge, and deep self-discovery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep, emotionally-driven storyline</strong><br>Experience Xiao Jun's life from a troubled childhood to a dark, complex adulthood filled with loss, loyalty, and revenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <strong>Multiple chapters spanning rural and urban environments</strong><br>From dusty village paths to neon-lit alleyways, explore evolving settings that reflect Xiao Jun\u2019s personal transformation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Turn-based combat with strategic elements</strong><br>Face bullies, gangsters, and inner demons through a combat system that blends street fights with psychological tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6b <strong>Character relationships and betrayal arcs</strong><br>Build friendships\u2014or destroy them. Trust is fragile, and betrayal cuts deep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Pixel-art visuals with cinematic storytelling</strong><br>A hand-crafted retro art style paired with dramatic cutscenes and a moody soundtrack.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3641820?t=1746659116","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3641820?t=1746659116","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641820/f8782c1c8bb31517450a1cbcaf403dcaf890266f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746659116","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite